=== 7. ACCEPTANCE FOR THE PROTOTYPE ===
- Every screen above is reachable by clicking, in both themes and both viewports.
- The Lock screen looks identical before any space is opened and after locking from either space.
- Seven taps on "Khong" open the same code sheet in Space A and Space B.
- After Lock now and the same code, the same history comes back.
- Settings, menus, and footnotes are identical in Space A and Space B.
- No banned word from section 0 appears anywhere in code or UI.
- No network request, no web storage, no CDN asset.
